#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "</AccordionItem>\n"
#| "</Accordion>\n"
#| "The reference primitives in the Qiskit SDK perform local statevector simulations. These simulations do not support\n"
#| "modeling device noise, but are useful for quickly prototyping algorithms before looking into more advanced simulation\n"
#| "techniques ([using Qiskit Aer](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits)) or running on real devices ([Qiskit Runtime primitives](primitives)).\n"
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"The reference primitives in the Qiskit SDK perform local statevector simulations. These simulations do not support\n"
"modeling device noise, but are useful for quickly prototyping algorithms before looking into more advanced simulation\n"
"techniques ([using Qiskit Aer](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits)) or running on real devices ([IBM Quantum primitives](primitives)).\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Primitif referensi di Qiskit SDK melakukan simulasi statevector lokal. Simulasi ini tidak mendukung\n"
"pemodelan noise perangkat, tetapi berguna untuk membuat prototipe algoritma dengan cepat sebelum melihat teknik simulasi\n"
"yang lebih canggih ([menggunakan Qiskit Aer](/guides/simulate-stabilizer-circuits)) atau menjalankan pada perangkat nyata ([Qiskit Runtime primitives](primitives)).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Estimator primitive can compute expectation values of circuits, and the Sampler primitive can sample\n"
"from output distributions of circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primitif Estimator dapat menghitung nilai ekspektasi dari Circuit, dan primitif Sampler dapat mengambil sampel\n"
"dari distribusi output Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following sections show how to use the reference primitives to run your workflow locally.\n"
msgstr "Bagian berikut menunjukkan cara menggunakan primitif referensi untuk menjalankan alur kerjamu secara lokal.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the reference Estimator {#use-the-reference-estimator}"
msgstr "Gunakan Estimator referensi {#use-the-reference-estimator}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The reference implementation of `EstimatorV2` in `qiskit.primitives` that runs on a local statevector\n"
"simulators is the [`StatevectorEstimator`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator) class. It can take circuits, observables, and parameters as inputs and returns the locally computed expectation values.\n"
msgstr ""
"Implementasi referensi dari `EstimatorV2` di `qiskit.primitives` yang berjalan pada simulator statevector lokal\n"
"adalah kelas [`StatevectorEstimator`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator). Ia dapat menerima Circuit, observable, dan parameter sebagai input dan mengembalikan nilai ekspektasi yang dihitung secara lokal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code prepares the inputs that will be used in the examples that follow. The expected input type for the\n"
"observables is [`qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp). Note that\n"
"the circuit in the example is parametrized, but you can also run Estimator on non-parametrized circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode berikut mempersiapkan input yang akan digunakan dalam contoh-contoh berikutnya. Tipe input yang diharapkan untuk\n"
"observable adalah [`qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.SparsePauliOp). Perhatikan bahwa\n"
"Circuit dalam contoh ini bersifat parametrized, tetapi kamu juga bisa menjalankan Estimator pada Circuit yang tidak diparametrasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  Any circuit passed to an Estimator must **not** include any **measurements**.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"  Setiap sirkuit yang diteruskan ke Estimator **tidak boleh** menyertakan **pengukuran** apa pun.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-sdk-primitives/extracted-outputs/5b41a52d-8f15-4ce4-b3f6-effd91946d9c-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-sdk-primitives/extracted-outputs/5b41a52d-8f15-4ce4-b3f6-effd91946d9c-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Transpile to ISA circuits and observables\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Transpile ke ISA circuits dan observable\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The IBM Quantum primitives workflow requires circuits and observables to be transformed to only use instructions supported by the QPU (referred to as *instruction set architecture (ISA)* circuits and observables). The reference primitives still accept abstract instructions, as they rely on local statevector simulations, but transpiling the circuit might still be beneficial in terms of circuit optimization.\n"
msgstr "  Alur kerja primitif IBM Quantum memerlukan Circuit dan observable untuk diubah agar hanya menggunakan instruksi yang didukung oleh QPU (disebut sebagai *instruction set architecture (ISA)* Circuit dan observable). Primitif referensi masih menerima instruksi abstrak, karena mereka mengandalkan simulasi statevector lokal, tetapi men-transpile Circuit mungkin tetap bermanfaat dari segi optimasi Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize Estimator {#initialize-estimator}"
msgstr "Inisialisasi Estimator {#initialize-estimator}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instantiate a [`qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator).\n"
msgstr "Buat instance [`qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run and get results {#run-and-get-results}"
msgstr "Jalankan dan dapatkan hasil {#run-and-get-results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example only uses one circuit (of type [`QuantumCircuit`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)) and one\n"
"observable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh ini hanya menggunakan satu Circuit (bertipe [`QuantumCircuit`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)) dan satu\n"
"observable.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the estimation by calling the [`StatevectorEstimator.run`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator#run) method, which returns an instance of a [`PrimitiveJob`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveJob) object. You can get the results from the job (as a [`qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult) object)\n"
"with the [`qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveJob.result`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveJob#result) method.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan estimasi dengan memanggil metode [`StatevectorEstimator.run`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorEstimator#run), yang mengembalikan instance dari objek [`PrimitiveJob`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveJob). Kamu bisa mendapatkan hasil dari job (sebagai objek [`qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveResult))\n"
"dengan metode [`qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveJob.result`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PrimitiveJob#result).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get the expected value from the result {#get-the-expected-value-from-the-result}"
msgstr "Dapatkan nilai ekspektasi dari hasil {#get-the-expected-value-from-the-result}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The primitives result outputs an array of [`PubResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult#pubresult) objects, where each item of the array is a `PubResult` object that contains in its data the array of evaluations corresponding to every circuit-observable combination in the PUB.\n"
msgstr "Output hasil primitif berupa array dari objek [`PubResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult#pubresult), di mana setiap item dalam array adalah objek `PubResult` yang berisi dalam datanya array evaluasi yang sesuai dengan setiap kombinasi Circuit-observable dalam PUB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To retrieve the expectation values and metadata for the first (and in this case, only) circuit evaluation, we must access the evaluation [`data`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult#data) for PUB 0:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengambil nilai ekspektasi dan metadata untuk evaluasi Circuit pertama (dan dalam hal ini satu-satunya), kita harus mengakses [`data`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.PubResult#data) evaluasi untuk PUB 0:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set Estimator run options {#set-estimator-run-options}"
msgstr "Atur opsi run Estimator {#set-estimator-run-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By default, the reference Estimator performs an exact statevector calculation based on the\n"
"[`quantum_info.Statevector`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector) class.\n"
"However, this can be modified to introduce the effect of the sampling overhead (also known as \"shot noise\").\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara default, Estimator referensi melakukan perhitungan statevector eksak berdasarkan\n"
"kelas [`quantum_info.Statevector`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector).\n"
"Namun, ini bisa dimodifikasi untuk memperkenalkan efek dari sampling overhead (juga dikenal sebagai \"shot noise\").\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Estimator accepts a `precision` argument that expresses the error bars that the\n"
"primitive implementation should target for expectation values estimates.  This is the sampling overhead and is defined exclusively in the `.run()` method. This  lets you fine-tune the option all the way to the PUB level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Estimator menerima argumen `precision` yang mengekspresikan error bar yang harus dicapai oleh\n"
"implementasi primitif untuk estimasi nilai ekspektasi. Ini adalah sampling overhead dan didefinisikan secara eksklusif di metode `.run()`. Ini memungkinkan kamu menyesuaikan opsi hingga ke tingkat PUB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a full example, see the [Estimator examples](/guides/estimator-examples) page.\n"
msgstr "Untuk contoh lengkap, lihat halaman [Contoh Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the reference Sampler {#use-the-reference-sampler}"
msgstr "Gunakan Sampler referensi {#use-the-reference-sampler}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The reference implementations of `SamplerV2` in `qiskit.primitives` is the [`StatevectorSampler`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorSampler) class. It takes circuits and parameters as inputs and returns the results from sampling from the output probability distributions as a quasi-probability distribution of output states.\n"
msgstr "Implementasi referensi dari `SamplerV2` di `qiskit.primitives` adalah kelas [`StatevectorSampler`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorSampler). Ia menerima Circuit dan parameter sebagai input dan mengembalikan hasil dari pengambilan sampel dari distribusi probabilitas output sebagai distribusi kuasi-probabilitas dari state output.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code prepares the inputs used in the examples that follow. Note that\n"
"these examples run a single parametrized circuit, but you can also run Sampler\n"
"on non-parametrized circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kode berikut mempersiapkan input yang digunakan dalam contoh-contoh berikutnya. Perhatikan bahwa\n"
"contoh-contoh ini menjalankan satu Circuit yang diparametrasi, tetapi kamu juga bisa menjalankan Sampler\n"
"pada Circuit yang tidak diparametrasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-sdk-primitives/extracted-outputs/d4c0ac3b-8e5b-4cde-bb26-256324982c2c-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/simulate-with-qiskit-sdk-primitives/extracted-outputs/d4c0ac3b-8e5b-4cde-bb26-256324982c2c-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Any quantum circuit passed to a Sampler **must** include measurements.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Setiap rangkaian kuantum yang diteruskan ke Sampler **harus** menyertakan pengukuran.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  The IBM Quantum primitives workflow requires circuits to be transformed to only use instructions supported by the QPU (referred to as ISA circuits). The reference primitives still accept abstract instructions, as they rely on local statevector simulations, but transpiling the circuit might still be beneficial in terms of circuit optimization.\n"
msgstr "  Alur kerja primitif IBM Quantum memerlukan Circuit untuk diubah agar hanya menggunakan instruksi yang didukung oleh QPU (disebut sebagai ISA Circuit). Primitif referensi masih menerima instruksi abstrak, karena mereka mengandalkan simulasi statevector lokal, tetapi men-transpile Circuit mungkin tetap bermanfaat dari segi optimasi Circuit.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize `SamplerV2` {#initialize-samplerv2}"
msgstr "Inisialisasi `SamplerV2` {#initialize-samplerv2}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instantiate [`qiskit.primitives.StatevectorSampler`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorSampler):\n"
msgstr "Buat instance [`qiskit.primitives.StatevectorSampler`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.primitives.StatevectorSampler):\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run and get results {#run-and-get-results-1}"
msgstr "Jalankan dan dapatkan hasil {#run-and-get-results-1}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Primitives accept multiple PUBs as inputs, and each PUB gets its own result. Therefore, you can run different circuits with various parameter/observable combinations, and retrieve the PUB results:\n"
msgstr "Primitif menerima beberapa PUB sebagai input, dan setiap PUB mendapatkan hasilnya sendiri. Oleh karena itu, kamu bisa menjalankan berbagai Circuit dengan kombinasi parameter/observable yang berbeda, dan mengambil hasil PUB:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get the probability distribution or measurement outcome {#get-the-probability-distribution-or-measurement-outcome}"
msgstr "Dapatkan distribusi probabilitas atau hasil pengukuran {#get-the-probability-distribution-or-measurement-outcome}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Measurement outcome samples are returned as **bitstrings** or **counts**. The bitstrings show the measurement outcomes, preserving the shot order in which they were measured. The Sampler result objects organize data in terms of their input circuits' classical register names, for compatibility with dynamic circuits.\n"
msgstr "Sampel hasil pengukuran dikembalikan sebagai **bitstring** atau **counts**. Bitstring menampilkan hasil pengukuran, mempertahankan urutan shot di mana mereka diukur. Objek hasil Sampler mengorganisir data berdasarkan nama register klasik dari Circuit input mereka, untuk kompatibilitas dengan sirkuit dinamis.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The name of the classical register defaults to `\"meas\"`. This name will be used later to access the measurement bitstrings.\n"
" </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Nama register klasik secara default adalah `\"meas\"`. Nama ini akan digunakan nanti untuk mengakses bitstring pengukuran.\n"
" </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change run options {#change-run-options}"
msgstr "Ubah opsi run {#change-run-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By default, the reference Sampler performs an exact statevector calculation based on the\n"
"[`quantum_info.Statevector`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector) class.\n"
"However, this can be modified to introduce the effect of the sampling overhead (also known as \"shot noise\"). To help manage this overhead, the Sampler interface accepts a `shots` argument that can be defined at the PUB level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara default, Sampler referensi melakukan perhitungan statevector eksak berdasarkan\n"
"kelas [`quantum_info.Statevector`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.quantum_info.Statevector).\n"
"Namun, ini bisa dimodifikasi untuk memperkenalkan efek dari sampling overhead (juga dikenal sebagai \"shot noise\"). Untuk membantu mengelola overhead ini, antarmuka Sampler menerima argumen `shots` yang dapat didefinisikan di tingkat PUB.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example assumes you have defined two circuits.\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini mengasumsikan kamu telah mendefinisikan dua Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a full example, see the [Sampler examples](/guides/sampler-examples) page.\n"
msgstr "Untuk contoh lengkap, lihat halaman [Contoh Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - For higher-performance simulation that can handle larger circuits, or to incorporate noise models into your simulation, see [Exact and noisy simulation with Qiskit Aer primitives](simulate-with-qiskit-aer).\n"
"  - To learn how to use Quantum Composer for simulation, see the [IBM Quantum Composer](/guides/composer) guide.\n"
"  - Read the [Qiskit Estimator API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Estimator) reference.\n"
"  - Read the [Qiskit Sampler API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Sampler) reference.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"  - Untuk simulasi berkinerja lebih tinggi yang dapat menangani Circuit yang lebih besar, atau untuk memasukkan model noise ke dalam simulasimu, lihat [Simulasi eksak dan berisik dengan primitif Qiskit Aer](simulate-with-qiskit-aer).\n"
"  - Untuk mempelajari cara menggunakan Quantum Composer untuk simulasi, lihat panduan [IBM Quantum Composer](/guides/composer).\n"
"  - Baca referensi [Qiskit Estimator API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Estimator).\n"
"  - Baca referensi [Qiskit Sampler API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.primitives.Sampler).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
